  "schema:description": "The effects of HIV infection on immune cell exhaustion at the transcriptomic level was investigated by analyzing single-cell RNA sequencing of peripheral blood mononuclear cells from four healthy subjects (37,847 cells) and six HIV-infected donors (28,610 cells).",
